msgctxt "64"
msgid "Well, Aniki? Ready to get the fashion beatdown?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Actually, I'm pretty confident. How are you feeling, Rikiya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Oh, you don't gotta worry about me. I'll be just fine.\r\n"
"Anyway, lemme go grab Mitsuo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "We're back, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "What is it, Uncle Kaz? I'm not really feeling so good..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"You'll feel better soon, Mitsuo. We're gonna give you a\r\n"
"fashion makeover."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Whoa, really!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Heck yeah! You're gonna have to claw the ladies off ya,\r\n"
"and it'll all be thanks to me and my amazing taste!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "I dunno about this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"C'mon, it'll be fine! All you gotta do is put the clothes\r\n"
"on and tell us what you like better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "You can start with mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "I got you sunglasses and an American flag polo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"You gotta be kidding me, Aniki. The kid's gonna be too shy\r\n"
"to look in a damn mirror if you dress him up like that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "I got you an American flag polo and a ten gallon hat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"You gotta be kidding me, Aniki. The kid's gonna be too shy\r\n"
"to look in a damn mirror if you dress him up like that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "I got you sunglasses and a dragon print polo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"You gotta be kidding me, Aniki. The kid's gonna be too shy\r\n"
"to look in a damn mirror if you dress him up like that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "I got you a dragon print polo and a ten gallon hat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"You gotta be kidding me, Aniki. The kid's gonna be too shy\r\n"
"to look in a damn mirror if you dress him up like that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Really? But I thought fashion was all about standing out..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Oh he's gonna stand out, all right! Like a sore freaking\r\n"
"thumb!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Hm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"Not to worry, Mitsuo! I've got the solution to all your girl\r\n"
"troubles right here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Okay! What is it, Uncle Rikiya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"Man, you're gonna love this... Tada! A short jacket, baggy\r\n"
"pants, and of course you can't go anywhere without a nice\r\n"
"old school bag! It's kinda squished, but who cares?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Um..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"C'mon, it's my old gear from when I was in junior high!\r\n"
"Took a while to round it all up, mind you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"Girls go gaga for this bad boy stuff, trust me. You'll have\r\n"
"to beat 'em off with a stick! Well? You want it, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "No way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "Huh!? But, but, but... don't you wanna look cool!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"Yeah, that's why I'm not taking your clothes! Nobody wears\r\n"
"stuff like that anymore. And besides, why would I wear your\r\n"
"junior high clothes? I'm still in elementary school!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "I'd rather take the things Uncle Kaz picked out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"Heh. Who's behind the times now, Rikiya? I haven't seen\r\n"
"clothes like that in years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "Not like you did any better!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"Don't be like that. You lost fair and square. To me.\r\n"
"An \"old-timer.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "Why don't you go get changed, Mitsuo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "All right, but I'm not really feeling this either..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "Just try it on. It's good to change up your vibe sometimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "If you say so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "Are you sure this is cool? It feels kinda... not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I dunno about that. It looks like you just got back\r\n"
"from a vacation in Hawaii! Or maybe Guam?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid ""
"I don't think it's that bad. This kinda thing is all the\r\n"
"rage in the U.S., you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "Really? I didn't know you were into foreign fashion, Aniki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "Are you sure this is cool? It feels kinda... not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "Nothing cooler than a good old-fashioned rodeo, haha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid ""
"I don't think it's that bad. You know cowboy is actually\r\n"
"the most popular job in the U.S.?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "Really? I had no idea..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid "Are you sure this is cool? It feels kinda... not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "Heh, you look like a yakuza in trainin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid ""
"I don't think it's that bad. And hey, doesn't the dragon\r\n"
"print make you feel closer to your Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid "It's always dragons with you, Aniki..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid "Are you sure this is cool? It feels kinda... not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "You look like you're having an identity crisis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid ""
"I don't think it's that bad. And hey, doesn't the dragon\r\n"
"print make you feel closer to your Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid "It's always dragons with you, Aniki..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid ""
"All right, Mitsuo. Get over there and show Riona what\r\n"
"you've got!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid ""
"Hey, Riona. I couldn't find anyone else who wanted to go\r\n"
"to the movie with me, so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid "Are you sure you don't wanna come?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1132"
msgid "Uh, what are you wearing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't be caught dead in a movie theater with a guy\r\n"
"dressed like... that. Anyway, I already said I have plans."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1156"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1180"
msgid "Shit, he got flat-out rejected and insulted to boot..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1192"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1252"
msgid "Maybe she's just not into me, Uncle Kaz..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1288"
msgid ""
"Hey, you can't give up after one small failure. You have to\r\n"
"keep trying, Mitsuo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1300"
msgid "Maybe... but I think she likes this guy Okada from my class."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312"
msgid "Then you'll just have to prove you're better than him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1324"
msgid "What!? But he's really cool! And his dad's super rich!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1336"
msgid ""
"But you don't even know if he likes her. You can't ignore\r\n"
"how you feel, Mitsuo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1348"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1360"
msgid "Well? You like her, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1372"
msgid "...Yeah. I really like her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1384"
msgid "Then you know what you need to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1396"
msgid ""
"You're right. I'm not gonna give up! Anyway, I should go\r\n"
"grab Taichi. He said he'd see the movie with me if Riona\r\n"
"didn't wanna go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1408"
msgid "Heh, glad you have someone to go with."
msgstr ""

